  "content": "<figure><p><img src=\"https://static.files.bbci.co.uk/bbcdotcom/web/20261005-153342-40cbc1e8b4-web-3.23.0-2/grey-placeholder.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /><img src=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/480/cpsprodpb/a439/live/ffa871b0-c554-11f1-9cae-455625013d45.jpg.webp\" alt=\"BBC Weather Watchers/Wrightsaycheese A man in a red puffer jacket and white cargo trousers observes the Northern Lights in Craster, Northumberland. A mix of green and pink covers the sky above Dunstanburgh Castle's ruins and the North Sea.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" />BBC Weather Watchers/Wrightsaycheese</p><figcaption>A stargazer in Craster, Northumberland takes in the Aurora spectacle</figcaption></figure><p>Northern Lights illuminated the skies above the north east of England and Cumbria, dazzling photographers and stargazers.</p><p>The pink and green hues were on display on Saturday evening.</p><p>Known as the Aurora Borealis, the bright colours are a result of solar eruptions sending particles towards the Earth and interacting with particles in the atmosphere.</p><p>The Met Office said more sightings could be possible until Tuesday.</p><figure><p><img src=\"https://static.files.bbci.co.uk/bbcdotcom/web/20261005-153342-40cbc1e8b4-web-3.23.0-2/grey-placeholder.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /><img src=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/480/cpsprodpb/3c0c/live/da3c7a30-c553-11f1-9cae-455625013d45.jpg.webp\" alt=\"BBC Weather Watchers/Jonny Gios A green glow shines above the clouds. It is the background to a small domed shelter lit up in red as a tree with no leaves.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" />BBC Weather Watchers/Jonny Gios</p><figcaption>A green haze illuminated the skies above Kendal, in Cumbria</figcaption></figure><figure><p><img src=\"https://static.files.bbci.co.uk/bbcdotcom/web/20261005-153342-40cbc1e8b4-web-3.23.0-2/grey-placeholder.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /><img src=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/480/cpsprodpb/3198/live/48a93710-c554-11f1-9cae-455625013d45.jpg.webp\" alt=\"BBC Weather Watchers/simon A mix of pale green, pink and purple is illuminating the sky above Hartlepool's Steetley Pier. The sea water slightly reflects the lights.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" />BBC Weather Watchers/simon</p><figcaption>The Aurora was also visible in Hartlepool</figcaption></figure><figure><p><img src=\"https://static.files.bbci.co.uk/bbcdotcom/web/20261005-153342-40cbc1e8b4-web-3.23.0-2/grey-placeholder.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /><img src=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/480/cpsprodpb/0c86/live/95f7b640-c554-11f1-9cae-455625013d45.jpg.webp\" alt=\"BBC Weather Watchers/Minnie The sky glows in pink and green above the trees. There are several clouds.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" />BBC Weather Watchers/Minnie</p><figcaption>Consett, in County Durham, did not miss out on the stunning views </figcaption></figure><figure><p><img src=\"https://static.files.bbci.co.uk/bbcdotcom/web/20261005-153342-40cbc1e8b4-web-3.23.0-2/grey-placeholder.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /><img src=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/480/cpsprodpb/b948/live/7a5053a0-c556-11f1-9cae-455625013d45.jpg.webp\" alt=\"BBC Weather Watchers/murtontom A mix of green, blue, pink and a tinge of orange is illuminating the sky above the red and white Souter Lighthouse. There are several small houses next to it with the light on in several rooms.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" />BBC Weather Watchers/murtontom</p><figcaption>Photographers near Sunderland were also treated to the pink and green hues</figcaption></figure><figure><p><img src=\"https://static.files.bbci.co.uk/bbcdotcom/web/20261005-153342-40cbc1e8b4-web-3.23.0-2/grey-placeholder.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /><img src=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/480/cpsprodpb/e58f/live/16818690-c557-11f1-9cae-455625013d45.jpg.webp\" alt=\"BBC Weather Watchers/MovingStill A green streak crosses the sky in Saltburn as a pier leads into the North Sea.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" />BBC Weather Watchers/MovingStill</p><figcaption>Saltburn was illuminated on Saturday night</figcaption></figure><figure><p><img src=\"https://static.files.bbci.co.uk/bbcdotcom/web/20261005-153342-40cbc1e8b4-web-3.23.0-2/grey-placeholder.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /><img src=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/480/cpsprodpb/1a4b/live/275b12f0-c558-11f1-9cae-455625013d45.jpg.webp\" alt=\"BBC Weather Watchers/Pootles and Pics A green glow crosses the sky above tree solhouttes.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" />BBC Weather Watchers/Pootles and Pics</p><figcaption>A green glow could be seen in the sky above Shotley Bridge</figcaption></figure><figure><p><img src=\"https://static.files.bbci.co.uk/bbcdotcom/web/20261005-153342-40cbc1e8b4-web-3.23.0-2/grey-placeholder.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /><img src=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/480/cpsprodpb/e184/live/2262d330-c555-11f1-9cae-455625013d45.jpg.webp\" alt=\"BBC Weather Watchers/ Chardypop Clouds cross the path of a green glow from the Northern Lights as a layer of pink rises above them.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" />BBC Weather Watchers/ Chardypop</p><figcaption>Clouds did not manage to spoil the pink and green spectacle in Brampton, Cumbria</figcaption></figure><p>More on this story </p>"
